AI-Provider Threat Indicator Corpus
====================================

This repository aggregates and normalizes threat indicators published by
third parties. The corpus structure, schema, and scripts are licensed under
the MIT License (see LICENSE). The underlying indicators are the work of their
respective publishers and are redistributed here for defensive security
research, with per-row attribution via the `source_url` column.

